---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What this site does and does not collect.">
  <div class="container prose" style="padding-top:var(--space-8)">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted small">Last updated 2026-10-13. Review with docs/MONETIZATION.md before enabling ads; AdSense requires specific disclosures.</p>
    <h2>Your data and the tools</h2>
    <p>All tools compute entirely in your browser. Data you enter or files you open are processed on your device and are never transmitted to us. Some tools may save your settings in your browser's local storage; this stays on your device.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
    <p>The site is served by Cloudflare, which processes IP addresses and request logs to deliver content and protect against abuse. We use privacy-preserving, cookie-free aggregate analytics (if enabled) to count page views.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>We display ads to keep the site free. Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits. You may opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a>. Visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland are shown a consent dialog before any advertising cookies are set.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
